From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:32:30 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] add Fossil Gen 6 device support (devices/fossil-hoki)

Add the Fossil Gen 6 (hoki) device configuration and its Snapdragon Wear
4100 family variants:

- display, touch, crown, haptics, audio routing, and firmware loaders
- vendor kernel derivation that fetches the six upstream AsteroidOS
  kernel patches from the pinned meta-smartwatch revision instead of
  vendoring their contents
- fossil-firefish, fossil-ray, and fossil-triggerfish family entries

Install the compositor environment as
/var/lib/environment/compositor/20-device.conf with the hwcomposer QPA,
and keep the underclock and WLAN firmware setup services non-blocking so
they cannot hold multi-user.target.
---
 devices/fossil-firefish/default.nix       |  56 ++++
 devices/fossil-hoki/android-init.nix      |  63 ++++
 devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix           | 339 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 devices/fossil-hoki/gps_xtra.ini          |   2 +
 devices/fossil-hoki/hybris-android.nix    |  22 ++
 devices/fossil-hoki/hybris.nix            |  38 +++
 devices/fossil-hoki/kernel/default.nix    | 109 +++++++
 devices/fossil-hoki/wlan-firmware-hoki.sh |  19 ++
 devices/fossil-ray/default.nix            |  56 ++++
 devices/fossil-triggerfish/default.nix    |  56 ++++
 10 files changed, 760 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 devices/fossil-firefish/default.nix
 create mode 100644 devices/fossil-hoki/android-init.nix
 create mode 100644 devices/fossil-hoki/default.nix
 create mode 100644 devices/fossil-hoki/gps_xtra.ini
 create mode 100644 devices/fossil-hoki/hybris-android.nix
 create mode 100644 devices/fossil-hoki/hybris.nix
 create mode 100644 devices/fossil-hoki/kernel/default.nix
 create mode 100644 devices/fossil-hoki/wlan-firmware-hoki.sh
 create mode 100644 devices/fossil-ray/default.nix
